SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT licence covers the source code in this repository that was written by
Kesowa Infinite Ventures.

It does NOT grant rights in:

  * Trained model weights distributed here (*.h5, *.onnx, *.pt, *.pkl). Several
